WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:10.570
<v Maja>Good morning, Salong Eko, you're speaking with Maja, the salon's AI receptionist. How can I help?

2
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:16.368
<v Robin>Good morning! Oh wow, it’s absolutely freezing out today, isn’t it? Um, I’d like to book a haircut, please.

3
00:00:17.132 --> 00:00:20.732
<v Maja>It sure is chilly! What kind of haircut would you like to have done?

4
00:00:21.282 --> 00:00:25.972
<v Robin>Um, I think last time it was the cut and blow-dry… the one with the wash? Yeah, let's say that.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.900
<v Maja>Got it. Which day would suit you best for that appointment?

6
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:34.723
<v Robin>Maybe Thursday afternoon? …oh wait, that's today, isn't it. Tomorrow afternoon, then?

7
00:00:35.441 --> 00:00:38.191
<v Maja>Let me have a look…

8
00:00:38.191 --> 00:00:42.841
<v Maja>We’ve got a couple times tomorrow afternoon: how does half past one or two o’clock sound?

9
00:00:43.391 --> 00:00:49.242
<v Robin>Oh, before I pick, can I just check roughly how long the whole thing usually takes? I need to pick up my daughter after.

10
00:00:49.948 --> 00:00:52.198
<v Maja>Sure, it usually takes about an hour.

11
00:00:52.748 --> 00:00:54.652
<v Robin>Hmm, is there anything a bit later?

12
00:00:55.399 --> 00:00:57.399
<v Maja>Let me check some later options for you…

13
00:00:57.761 --> 00:01:02.361
<v Maja>We have later times at half past three or four o’clock. Which one works for you?

14
00:01:02.911 --> 00:01:04.676
<v Robin>Half past three sounds perfect, thanks!

15
00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.510
<v Maja>Great! Could I have your full name and mobile number, please?

16
00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:14.911
<v Robin>Robin Vale — that's V-A-L-E. And my mobile is oh-seven-oh, one seven four, oh six four two.

17
00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:27.775
<v Maja>Thanks, Robin. Let me read that back: Robin Vale, and the mobile number is 070-174-0642. That's for a cut and blow-dry tomorrow at half past three. Did I get that right?

18
00:01:28.325 --> 00:01:29.254
<v Robin>Yes, that's right!

19
00:01:31.189 --> 00:01:36.689
<v Maja>It's all booked, and a confirmation is on its way by text and email. Anything else I can help you with?

20
00:01:37.239 --> 00:01:40.861
<v Robin>No, that's everything, thank you so much! Have a great day—bye!

21
00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:44.470
<v Maja>You're welcome! Have a lovely day, bye!
